### Strict Guardrails (Tech Writing)
- Ground all narrative content in the verified research YAML notes.
- This PR transitions `{{ task.project_name }}` from `first_pass` to `tech_writing`.
- Deliver the Hugo tool markdown page and tracker content task update in this PR.

{% elif task.target_stage == "approved" %}
