   `uv run python scripts/validate_grounding.py {{ task.research_file }}`

2. **Apply Editorial Lock:**
   Set `editorial_lock: true` in:
   `{{ task.research_file }}`
   In `{{ task.tool_page_file }}`, ensure frontmatter has `lifecycle_stage: approved`.

### Strict Guardrails (Editorial Approval)
- This PR transitions `{{ task.project_name }}` from `tech_writing` to `approved`.
